# MCP server config — carries an API key in a header. Never commit.
.mcp.json


# TypeScript incremental build cache — a build artifact, not source.
*.tsbuildinfo

# The storyboard deck and its stills are BUILT from gitignored docs/local/ by
# scripts/sync-storyboard.sh, but the built output is tracked on purpose — it is
# the one video doc we publish. Re-run `npm run sync:storyboard` after editing
# the source; commit the result.
#   public/storyboard.html
#   public/demo-video-assets/

# The three demo-video briefs, copied into public/ by the same script so the
# storyboard's "brief" links resolve on the live site. These stay out of the
# repo — they are working notes, not a deck. The repo copy's brief links are
# dead by design; the live copy's work.
public/myspace-prototype.md
public/feed-prototype.md
public/chat-prototype.md
